  "goodToKnow": "Die Ermordung is the murder or assassination of a specific person: die Ermordung Kennedys, die Ermordung der europäischen Juden (the murder of the European Jews, a common term for the Holocaust). The verb ermorden takes an object: Er wurde ermordet. Der Mord is murder as a crime. The 1914 Ermordung of Archduke Franz Ferdinand in Sarajevo triggered the First World War. Plural: die Ermordungen."
